<title>USA: PNC says Scheuring to step down.</title>
<headline>PNC says Scheuring to step down.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Bank Corp said Friday that Garry Scheuring will step down as vice chairman and a member of the office of the chairman, effective Feb. 28, to pursue other interests.  Scheuring, 57, will continue as a director.</p>
</text>
